 "The address is where the follower can be reached (its tunnel or public URL): the leader uses it to announce address changes before the follower first connects. Leave it empty if unsure.": "地址是可访问该从服务器的位置（其隧道或公开 URL）：在从服务器首次连接之前，主服务器用它通知地址变更。不确定时请留空。",
 "The leader's tunnel or public URL (https://...), copied from its Cluster sync page. Over the internet, always https.": "主服务器的隧道或公开 URL（https://...），从其集群同步页面复制。通过互联网时务必使用 https。",
