 "Theme": "主题",
 "This address is already in the list": "此地址已在列表中",
 "This server becomes the primary: you edit the configuration here, then add other servers with join codes.": "此服务器将成为主服务器：你在这里编辑配置，然后用加入代码添加其他服务器。",
 "This server copies the configuration of a leader.": "此服务器复制主服务器的配置。",
 "This server is a member: it copies the primary's configuration, which is read-only here.": "此服务器是成员：它复制主服务器的配置，此处为只读。",
 "This server is the primary: configuration changes made here are copied to every member.": "此服务器是主服务器：在这里所做的配置更改会复制到每个成员。",
 "This server only listens on 127.0.0.1 and has no tunnel or public URL, so other computers cannot reach it. Start a tunnel on the Endpoints page, or set OCRROUTE_HOST=0.0.0.0 in .env and restart.": "此服务器只监听 127.0.0.1，且没有隧道或公开 URL，其他计算机无法访问。请在端点页面启动隧道，或在 .env 中设置 OCRROUTE_HOST=0.0.0.0 并重启。",
 "This server only listens on 127.0.0.1, so other computers cannot reach it. Set OCRROUTE_HOST=0.0.0.0 in the .env file, restart, and allow the port in the firewall.": "此服务器只监听 127.0.0.1，其他计算机无法访问。请在 .env 文件中设置 OCRROUTE_HOST=0.0.0.0，重启并在防火墙中放行端口。",
